  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1272997,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "Snodge the Biblet returns in a vibrant, action-packed celebration of 15 years of Nyaaaah! gaming! The evil Biblet Ruler has imprisoned Snodge’s friends, holding them captive in a grim hut guarded by relentless minions. It's up to you to guide Snodge on a perilous quest to thwart the Ruler's wicked scheme and rescue his companions.\n\nThis isn't your typical adventure; prepare for a unique blend of shoot 'em up and lick 'em up gameplay! Initially, Snodge defends himself with a comical licking attack. However, collecting coloured magic potion bottles transforms his abilities. Drink a potion and gain powerful new weapons – unleash mini bolts, devastating mega bolts, or revert to the default licking attack.\n\nDeveloped by Richard Bayliss, the game pushes the Commodore 64's SEUCK engine to its absolute limit, delivering stunning visuals and frantic, addictive gameplay. Experience a meticulously crafted world, challenging enemies, and a quirky narrative that honors the legacy of Nyaaaah! Can you save Snodge's friends and defeat the Biblet Ruler?"
    },
